ent and balance 10%/5%/2% payment.</p><p><strong>1. </strong>प्रमाणित किया जाता है कि पिछले पृष्ठ पर और ………………… जारी संलग्न पत्रों पर प्राप्त दिखाया गया सामान नीचे 3 में दी गई अस्वीकृतियों के अधीन अच्छी हालत में प्राप्त हुआ है।</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>रकम</p><p>Amount &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>मात्रा</p><p>Quantity &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>मंडल या क्षेत्र &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; स्थान &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;हस्ताक्षर<br>Circle of area ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Signature ………………………</p><p>तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; पदनाम &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>Dated ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Designation ………………………</p><p>(स्थानीय परिवहन के मामले में)<br>(In the case of a Local Delivery)</p><p>यह एक कच्ची रसीद है। वह केवल परिशिष्ट द्वारा सामान मिलने की रसीद मानी जाएगी और मात्र इससे ठेके की सामान्य शर्तों के अधीन सामान का निरीक्षण करने और उसे अस्वीकार करने से उससे अधिकारों पर कोई प्रतिकूल प्रभाव नहीं पड़ेगा। यह इस कथित आधार पर जारी की जाती है कि ठेकेदार वास्तव में परिवहित की कुल मात्रा को सिद्ध करने के लिए उत्तरदायी होगा।</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is the provisional receipt. It only acknowledges receipt of stores by the consignee and is without prejudice to his right of inspection and rejection under the general conditions of contract. It is issued on said container basis, the contractor remaining responsible for proving the total quantities actually delivered.</p><p>स्थान / Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; परिप्राप्ति के हस्ताक्षर / Signature of Consignee ………………………</p><p>तारीख / Date ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;पदनाम मोहर सहित / Designation (with rubber stamp) ………………………</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>नोट / Note:</strong></p><ol><li>इस प्रमाण-पत्र पर निरीक्षक या पूर्ति अथवा प्राधिकारी में निर्दिष्ट परिप्राप्ति के हस्ताक्षर स्याही में होने चाहिए। जहाँ यह संभव न हो अथवा अनुपयुक्त हो वहाँ परिप्राप्ति द्वारा विधिवत अधिकृत अधिकारी के हस्ताक्षर होने चाहिए। ऐसी स्थिति में प्रमाण-पत्र पर हस्ताक्षर करने वाले अधिकारी को अपना तथा जिम्मेदारी अंग में वह हस्ताक्षर कर रहा है, उस अधिकारी के पदनाम का उल्लेख करना चाहिए।<br>This Certificate should be signed in ink by the Consignee specified in the A/T or S/Order. Where this is not possible or inconvenient it should be signed by an officer duly authorised by the consignee in that behalf. In such case the official signing the receipt Certificate should indicate his designation of the official on whose behalf he is signing.</li><li>परिप्राप्ति को चाहिए कि वह सामान प्राप्त होने की तारीख के …………………… के अन्दर इन प्रतियों को आवश्यक टिप्पणी सहित आवश्यक लौटा दें।<br>Consignee must return these copies with his remarks as required within ………………………………… from the date of receipt of Stores.</li><li>यदि सभी सामान अस्वीकृत कर दिए जाएँ तो केवल प्रति सं. 3, 6, 7 और 9 ही जारी की जाएँगी।<br>In case of total rejection copies Nos. <strong>3, 6, 7 and 9</strong> only will be issued.</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ANNEXURE I TO INOTE NO. 2025-26-022-139-WP-02&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dated 17/01/2026</p><p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n      <th>Item No in A/T (OL No)</th>\n      <th colspan=\"2\"><u>Description of store</u>Total Quantity Ordered<br/>The Inspector should indicate whether the Supply has been made in seller\'s / buyer\'s</th>\n      <th>Acc Unit</th><th>Tendered Quantity</th><th>Accepted Quantity</th><th>Brought to account in ledger folio Total Qty Accepted to</th>\n      <th>Rejected Quantity</th><th>No and date of inspection certificate (if any) issued by DGISM or other Insp. Authority</th>\n      <th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>EV6091B-88-284<br/>SPRING BOLT</td><td>Qty 32</td>\n        <td>no</td><td>32</td><td>3</td><td>3 / 32</td><td>0</td><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>EV6091B-88-284<br/>SPRING BOLT</td><td>Qty 32</td>\n        <td>no</td><td>32</td><td>3</td><td>3 / 32</td><td>0</td><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr></table></p>', 139, '2026-01-17 07:19:48', '2026-01-17 07:19:48', '18VBBC001');
INSERT INTO `certificate` (`id`, `content`, `i_note`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `indent_No`) VALUES
(23, '<figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>दुरध्वनी &nbsp; 022-2266 4583/3678<br>फैक्स &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;022-2266 2077<br>ईमेल &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;cqaems@navy.gov.in<br>वेबसाइट &nbsp;www.dgqadefence.gov.in</td><td><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:90/90;\" src=\"http://localhost:3000/uploads/file-1767540277911.png\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></figure></td><td>रक्षा मंत्रालय (गु. आ. भ. नि.)<br>Ministry of Defence (DGQA)<br>मुख्य गुणवत्ता आश्वासन स्थापना (कल पुर्जे)<br>Chief Quality Assurance Establishment&nbsp;<br>(Machinery Spares)<br>7 वीं मंज़िल, एन एम आर एल कॉम्प्लेक्स<br>7th Floor, NMRL Complex<br>नौसेना गोदीबाड़ा, टाइगर गेट<br>Naval Dockyard, Tiger Gate<br>मुंबई Mumbai – 400 023</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>CQAE(MS)/10/CWH(V) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2024-11-14</p><p>मेवा में,<br>A605 jurs country jwalapur haridwar</p><p>श्री मान जी,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1. निमलिखित की प्रतिया (कापी संख्या 1 से 5) इस स्थापना द्वारा प्रगति हेतु भेजी जा रही है</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>ईन्स्पेक्सन नो संख्या और तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</td><td>आपूर्ति आदेश संख्या और तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td>वस्तु का विवरण &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>2025-26-022-140-WP-02<br>Dated &nbsp;2024-11-14</td><td>18VBBC001<br>Dated 17/01/2026</td><td>Spares</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>2. आपसे अनुरोध है कि उपरोक्त ईन्सपैक्सन नोट में वर्णित वस्तुओ को कन्टरोलर आफ वेयर हाउसींग (सप्लाई ओर्डर के अनुसार) को भेज दीजिए और दस्तावेज की सूचना इस कार्यालय को भी दे ।</p><p>धन्यवाद&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;भवदीय<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;कृते सी क्यू ए ओ (एम एम)</p><p>मंलग्रक: उपरोक्त दस्तावेज</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>प्रतिलिपि :- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>The Additional Director General &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;इन्स्पेक्शन नोट की कापी न. 7 के साथ<br>(for Director/Technical)<br>Directorate of Quality Assurance (WP)<br>Defence Office Complex<br>\'B\' Block, 6th Floor, Africa Avenue<br>Sarojini Nagar Post Office<br>New Delhi-110 023</p><p>THE CONTROLLERATE OF WAREHOUSING MATERIAL ORGANISATION (V)\r\nKANCHARAPALEM (POST),EASTERN NAVAL COMMAND,VISAKHAPATNAM 530008\r\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;इन्स्पेक्शन नोट की कापी न. 6 के साथ</p><p>THE CONTROLLERATE OF PROCUREMENT MATERIAL ORGANISATION (V)\r\nKANCHARAPALEM (POST),EASTERN NAVAL COMMAND,VISAKHAPATNAM 530008\r\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; इन्स्पेक्शन नोट की कापी न. 7 के साथ</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>भारत सरकार&nbsp;<br>GOVERNMENT OF INDIA&nbsp;<br>(पुर्ति विभाग)&nbsp;<br>Department of Supply</td><td>निरीक्षण पत्र<br><strong>INSPECTION NOTE</strong><br>1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र<br>INSPECTION NOTE NO. 2025-26-022-140-WP-02<br>1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र</td><td>म. सि. पू. नि. (एम) ८५<br>In lieu of D.GS &amp; D (S)-84</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>I. INSPECTION CERTIFICATE</strong></p><p>पूरी / आंशिक / अतिरिक्त आंशिक / समापन सुपुर्दगी &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;फाइल सं. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;इश्यू सं.<br>Delivery in Full/Part/Further part/Completion &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;File No. 10 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Issue No.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>*</strong>जो व्योग आवश्यक न हों उन्हें काट दें। &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;प्रति सं. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; प्रतियों की सं.<br>**Particulars Not Required to be deleted &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Copy No. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Number of Copies</p><ol><li>महानिदेशक (पूर्ति तथा निपटान) / पूर्ति निदेशक (केंद्रीय/चालू ठेका/नि. सं. और तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; आदेश सं. और तारीख<br>…. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Supply Order No and Date<br>DG(S&amp;D)/Dir. (S&amp;D)/D.S(Tax)/Rate/Running Contract / A.T. No and Date: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;18VBBC001 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 17/01/2026</li><li>का नाम और पता &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;A605 jurs country jwalapur haridwar<br>Contractor\'s Name and Address</li><li>मांगकता / Indentor &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;CPRO(CWH(V))&nbsp;</li><li>मांग पत्र म. और तारीख / Indent No and Date &nbsp; 18VBBC001 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dated &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;17/01/2026</li><li>परेषिती / Consignee &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;CWH(CWH(V))</li><li>प्रमाणित किया जाता है कि नीचे और इनमें संलग्न पत्र में दर्ज माल का निरीक्षण किया जा चुका है और परिणाम इस प्रकार है<br>Certified that stores noted below and in the continuation sheets attached have been inspected with results as shown: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>ACCEPTED</strong></li><li>(क) तारीख को सुपुर्द किए गए / रेल पर रखे गए / निरीक्षण के लिए रखे गए सामान &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (ख) माल निरीक्षण करने की तारीख<br>(a) Stores offered for inspection on&nbsp;<strong> &nbsp;</strong>2026-01-10<strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>(b) Stores inspected on 10/01/2026-14/02/2026</li><li>के सुपुर्दगी पत्र की संख्या और तारीख<br>Delivery Note no and Date</li><li>समय के अंदर अथवा सक्षम प्राधिकारी द्वारा बढ़ाए गए समय के अंदर मदों की पूर्ति की गई / नहीं की गई दण्ड के लिए पूर्ति अधिकारी को भेजी गई सूचना<br>The items were/were not supplied within the stipulated time or as extended by the competent authority / reference made to Supply Officer regarding penalty.</li></ol><p>निरीक्षण सामान का ब्यौरा<br><strong>DETAILS OF STORES INSPECTED</strong></p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>निविदा संख्या / मद सं.</td><td>सामान का विवरण<br>कुल कितनी मात्रा में आर्डर दिया गया तथा जिस डिब्बे में सामान भेजा जाना हो वहाँ निरीक्षक को इस बात का संकेत देना चाहिए कि क्या पूर्ति विक्रेता कंटा के डिब्बे में की गई है</td><td>लेखा इकाई</td><td>टेंडर किया गया</td><td>स्वीकृत</td><td>भण्डार पन्ना में दर्ज किया गया आज की तारीख तक स्वीकृत कुल मात्रा</td><td>अस्वीकृति</td><td>डी. जी. आई. एस. एम. एम. लेनदेन या विदेश के किसी दूसरे प्राधिकारी द्वारा जारी किए (यदि कोई हो) निरीक्षण प्रमाण की सं. और तारीख</td><td>अभ्युक्तिय</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Item No in A/T</td><td><strong>Description of stores</strong><br>Total Quantity Ordered.<br>The Inspector should indicate whether the Supply has been made in seller’s/buyer’s containers, where stores are required to be supplied in containers.</td><td>Acc Unit</td><td>Tendered Quantity</td><td>Accepted Quantity</td><td><strong>Brought to account in ledger folio</strong><br>Total Qty Accepted to Date</td><td>Rejected Quantity</td><td>No and date of inspection certificate (if any) issued by DGISM or other Insp. Authority abroad</td><td><p><strong>Remarks</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><strong>AS GIVEN IN ANNEXURE</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>Remark: &nbsp; TOTAL ITEMS ACCEPTED ARE </strong>2<strong> NOS AND DETAILS ARE PLACED AT THE ANNEXURE I TO THIS I-NOTE.</strong><br>टिप्पणी : अंतिम मद के बाद में तत्काल एक रेखा खींची जाएगी या टाइप की जाएगी। रेखा के नीचे “भंडार का विवरण” नाम के खाने में पृथक रूप से दी गई मदों की कुल संख्या इस प्रकार दर्ज की जाएगी। निरीक्षण की गई मदों की संख्या ………………… (शब्दों में)</p><p><strong>Note:</strong>– A line to be drawn or typed immediately after the last item. Below the line will be entered the total no of items separately shown in the Col “DESCRIPTION OF STORES” thus ––––</p><p><strong>ITEMS INSPECTED NOS. 2 ONLY</strong></p><p><strong>स्थान / Station:</strong> Mumbai &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; निरीक्षक के हस्ताक्षर / Signature of CQAO (MS)</p><p><strong>तारीख / Date:</strong> <strong>21-Apr-2025</strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;पदनाम मोहर सहित / Designation (with rubber stamp)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>भारत सरकार&nbsp;<br>GOVERNMENT OF INDIA&nbsp;<br>(पुर्ति विभाग)&nbsp;<br>Department of Supply</td><td>निरीक्षण पत्र<br><strong>INSPECTION NOTE</strong><br>1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र<br>INSPECTION NOTE NO. 2025-26-022-140-WP-02<br>1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र</td><td>म. सि. पू. नि. (एम) ८५<br>In lieu of D.GS &amp; D (S)-84</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>10. </strong>केवल निरीक्षक की कार्यालय प्रति (सं. 7) में दर्ज किया जाए। अस्वीकृत माल वापस करने की रेलवे रसीद की सं. और तारीख<br>To be entered on inspection office copy (no 7) only (No and Date of Railway Receipt returning rejection &nbsp;……………………)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; को अस्वीकृत सामान प्राप्त हुआ   &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ठेकेदार के हस्ताक्षर<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(Received the Rejection On …………………… &nbsp; &nbsp;Contractor Signature ……………………)</p><p><strong>11. </strong>जिन मामलों में 90%/95%/98% अग्रिम अदायगी का दावा किया गया तथा निरीक्षण पत्र की प्रति संख्या 2, 4 और 5 में ठेकेदार दर्ज करेगा। 90%/95%/98% अग्रिम बिल की सं. और तारीख<br>To be entered on copies No 2, 4, and 5 of the inspection Note by the contractor in case in which Advance 90%/95%/98% payment has been claimed:</p><p>II – प्राप्ति प्रमाण पत्र<br><strong>II – RECEIPT CERTIFICATE</strong></p><p>(परिशिष्ट अंतिम 100% अदायगी प्रति सं. 1, 2, 4 और 5 में और अग्रिम 90%/95%/98% अदायगी तथा शेष 10%/5%/2% अदायगी के मामलों में प्रति सं. 2, 4 और 5 में दर्ज करेगा।)</p><p>To be completed by consignee on copies no 1, 2, 4 and 5 for Final 100% payment and on copies No 2, 4, 5 for advance 95%/98% payment and balance 10%/5%/2% payment.</p><p><strong>1. </strong>प्रमाणित किया जाता है कि पिछले पृष्ठ पर और ………………… जारी संलग्न पत्रों पर प्राप्त दिखाया गया सामान नीचे 3 में दी गई अस्वीकृतियों के अधीन अच्छी हालत में प्राप्त हुआ है।</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>रकम</p><p>Amount &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>मात्रा</p><p>Quantity &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>मंडल या क्षेत्र &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; स्थान &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;हस्ताक्षर<br>Circle of area ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Signature ………………………</p><p>तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; पदनाम &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>Dated ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Designation ………………………</p><p>(स्थानीय परिवहन के मामले में)<br>(In the case of a Local Delivery)</p><p>यह एक कच्ची रसीद है। वह केवल परिशिष्ट द्वारा सामान मिलने की रसीद मानी जाएगी और मात्र इससे ठेके की सामान्य शर्तों के अधीन सामान का निरीक्षण करने और उसे अस्वीकार करने से उससे अधिकारों पर कोई प्रतिकूल प्रभाव नहीं पड़ेगा। यह इस कथित आधार पर जारी की जाती है कि ठेकेदार वास्तव में परिवहित की कुल मात्रा को सिद्ध करने के लिए उत्तरदायी होगा।</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is the provisional receipt. It only acknowledges receipt of stores by the consignee and is without prejudice to his right of inspection and rejection under the general conditions of contract. It is issued on said container basis, the contractor remaining responsible for proving the total quantities actually delivered.</p><p>स्थान / Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; परिप्राप्ति के हस्ताक्षर / Signature of Consignee ………………………</p><p>तारीख / Date ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;पदनाम मोहर सहित / Designation (with rubber stamp) ………………………</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>नोट / Note:</strong></p><ol><li>इस प्रमाण-पत्र पर निरीक्षक या पूर्ति अथवा प्राधिकारी में निर्दिष्ट परिप्राप्ति के हस्ताक्षर स्याही में होने चाहिए। जहाँ यह संभव न हो अथवा अनुपयुक्त हो वहाँ परिप्राप्ति द्वारा विधिवत अधिकृत अधिकारी के हस्ताक्षर होने चाहिए। ऐसी स्थिति में प्रमाण-पत्र पर हस्ताक्षर करने वाले अधिकारी को अपना तथा जिम्मेदारी अंग में वह हस्ताक्षर कर रहा है, उस अधिकारी के पदनाम का उल्लेख करना चाहिए।<br>This Certificate should be signed in ink by the Consignee specified in the A/T or S/Order. Where this is not possible or inconvenient it should be signed by an officer duly authorised by the consignee in that behalf. In such case the official signing the receipt Certificate should indicate his designation of the official on whose behalf he is signing.</li><li>परिप्राप्ति को चाहिए कि वह सामान प्राप्त होने की तारीख के …………………… के अन्दर इन प्रतियों को आवश्यक टिप्पणी सहित आवश्यक लौटा दें।<br>Consignee must return these copies with his remarks as required within ………………………………… from the date of receipt of Stores.</li><li>यदि सभी सामान अस्वीकृत कर दिए जाएँ तो केवल प्रति सं. 3, 6, 7 और 9 ही जारी की जाएँगी।<br>In case of total rejection copies Nos. <strong>3, 6, 7 and 9</strong> only will be issued.</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ANNEXURE I TO INOTE NO. 2025-26-022-140-WP-02&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dated 17/01/2026</p><p><table border=