; &nbsp; &nbsp; निरीक्षण पत्र<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>INSPECTION NOTE</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र<br>INSPECTION NOTE NO. 2025-26-022-157-WP-02<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र</td><td>म. सि. पू. नि. (एम) ८५<br>In lieu of D.GS &amp; D (S)-84</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>10. </strong>केवल निरीक्षक की कार्यालय प्रति (सं. 7) में दर्ज किया जाए। अस्वीकृत माल वापस करने की रेलवे रसीद की सं. और तारीख<br>To be entered on inspection office copy (no 7) only (No and Date of Railway Receipt returning rejection &nbsp;……………………)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; को अस्वीकृत सामान प्राप्त हुआ   &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ठेकेदार के हस्ताक्षर<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(Received the Rejection On …………………… &nbsp; &nbsp;Contractor Signature ……………………)</p><p><strong>11. </strong>जिन मामलों में 90%/95%/98% अग्रिम अदायगी का दावा किया गया तथा निरीक्षण पत्र की प्रति संख्या 2, 4 और 5 में ठेकेदार दर्ज करेगा। 90%/95%/98% अग्रिम बिल की सं. और तारीख<br>To be entered on copies No 2, 4, and 5 of the inspection Note by the contractor in case in which Advance 90%/95%/98% payment has been claimed:</p><p>II – प्राप्ति प्रमाण पत्र<br><strong>II – RECEIPT CERTIFICATE</strong></p><p>(परिशिष्ट अंतिम 100% अदायगी प्रति सं. 1, 2, 4 और 5 में और अग्रिम 90%/95%/98% अदायगी तथा शेष 10%/5%/2% अदायगी के मामलों में प्रति सं. 2, 4 और 5 में दर्ज करेगा।)</p><p>To be completed by consignee on copies no 1, 2, 4 and 5 for Final 100% payment and on copies No 2, 4, 5 for advance 95%/98% payment and balance 10%/5%/2% payment.</p><p><strong>1. </strong>प्रमाणित किया जाता है कि पिछले पृष्ठ पर और ………………… जारी संलग्न पत्रों पर प्राप्त दिखाया गया सामान नीचे 3 में दी गई अस्वीकृतियों के अधीन अच्छी हालत में प्राप्त हुआ है।</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>रकम</p><p>Amount &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>मात्रा</p><p>Quantity &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>मंडल या क्षेत्र &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; स्थान &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;हस्ताक्षर<br>Circle of area ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Signature ………………………</p><p>तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; पदनाम &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>Dated ……………………… 