&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>INSPECTION NOTE</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र<br>INSPECTION NOTE NO. {{FINANCIAL_YEAR}}-022-{{INOTE_NO}}-WP-02<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1- निरीक्षण प्रमाण पत्र</td><td>म. सि. पू. नि. (एम) ८५<br>In lieu of D.GS &amp; D (S)-84</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>10. </strong>केवल निरीक्षक की कार्यालय प्रति (सं. 7) में दर्ज किया जाए। अस्वीकृत माल वापस करने की रेलवे रसीद की सं. और तारीख<br>To be entered on inspection office copy (no 7) only (No and Date of Railway Receipt returning rejection &nbsp;……………………)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; को अस्वीकृत सामान प्राप्त हुआ   &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ठेकेदार के हस्ताक्षर<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(Received the Rejection On …………………… &nbsp; &nbsp;Contractor Signature ……………………)</p><p><strong>11. </strong>जिन मामलों में 90%/95%/98% अग्रिम अदायगी का दावा किया गया तथा निरीक्षण पत्र की प्रति संख्या 2, 4 और 5 में ठेकेदार दर्ज करेगा। 90%/95%/98% अग्रिम बिल की सं. और तारीख<br>To be entered on copies No 2, 4, and 5 of the inspection Note by the contractor in case in which Advance 90%/95%/98% payment has been claimed:</p><p>II – प्राप्ति प्रमाण पत्र<br><strong>II – RECEIPT CERTIFICATE</strong></p><p>(परिशिष्ट अंतिम 100% अदायगी प्रति सं. 1, 2, 4 और 5 में और अग्रिम 90%/95%/98% अदायगी तथा शेष 10%/5%/2% अदायगी के मामलों में प्रति सं. 2, 4 और 5 में दर्ज करेगा।)</p><p>To be completed by consignee on copies no 1, 2, 4 and 5 for Final 100% payment and on copies No 2, 4, 5 for advance 95%/98% payment and balance 10%/5%/2% payment.</p><p><strong>1. </strong>प्रमाणित किया जाता है कि पिछले पृष्ठ पर और ………………… जारी संलग्न पत्रों पर प्राप्त दिखाया गया सामान नीचे 3 में दी गई अस्वीकृतियों के अधीन अच्छी हालत में प्राप्त हुआ है।</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>रकम</p><p>Amount &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td><p>मद</p><p>Item &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>कारण</p><p>Reason &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>मात्रा</p><p>Quantity &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>मंडल या क्षेत्र &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; स्थान &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;हस्ताक्षर<br>Circle of area ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Signature ………………………</p><p>तारीख &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; पदनाम &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>Dated ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Designation ………………………</p><p>(स्थानीय परिवहन के मामले में)<br>(In the case of a Local Delivery)</p><p>यह एक कच्ची रसीद है। वह केवल परिशिष्ट द्वारा सामान मिलने की रसीद मानी जाएगी और मात्र इससे ठेके की सामान्य शर्तों के अधीन सामान का निरीक्षण करने और उसे अस्वीकार करने से उससे अधिकारों पर कोई प्रतिकूल प्रभाव नहीं पड़ेगा। यह इस कथित आधार पर जारी की जाती है कि ठेकेदार वास्तव में परिवहित की कुल मात्रा को सिद्ध करने के लिए उत्तरदायी होगा।</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is the provisional receipt. It only acknowledges receipt of stores by the consignee and is without prejudice to his right of inspection and rejection under the general conditions of contract. It is issued on said container basis, the contractor remaining responsible for proving the total quantities actually delivered.</p><p>स्थान / Station ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; परिप्राप्ति के हस्ताक्षर / Signature of Consignee ………………………</p><p>तारीख / Date ……………………… &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;पदनाम मोहर सहित / Designation (with rubber stamp) ………………………</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>नोट / Note:</strong></p><ol><li>इस प्रमाण-पत्र पर निरीक्षक या पूर्ति अथवा प्राधिकारी में निर्दिष्ट परिप्राप्ति के हस्ताक्षर स्याही में होने चाहिए। जहाँ यह संभव न हो अथवा अनुपयुक्त हो वहाँ परिप्राप्ति द्वारा विधिवत अधिकृत अधिकारी के हस्ताक्षर होने चाहिए। ऐसी स्थिति में प्रमाण-पत्र पर हस्ताक्षर करने वाले अधिकारी को अपना तथा जिम्मेदारी अंग में वह हस्ताक्षर कर रहा है, उस अधिकारी के पदनाम का उल्लेख करना चाहिए।<br>This Certificate should be signed in ink by the Consignee specified in the A/T or S/Order. Where this is not possible or inconvenient it should be signed by an officer duly authorised by the consignee in that behalf. In such case the official signing the receipt Certificate should indicate his designation of the official on whose behalf he is signing.</li><li>परिप्राप्ति को चाहिए कि वह सामान प्राप्त होने की तारीख के …………………… के अन्दर इन प्रतियों को आवश्यक टिप्पणी सहित आवश्यक लौटा दें।<br>Consignee must return these copies with his remarks as required within ………………………………… from the date of receipt of Stores.</li><li>यदि सभी सामान अस्वीकृत कर दिए जाएँ तो केवल प्रति सं. 3, 6, 7 और 9 ही जारी की जाएँगी।<br>In case of total rejection copies Nos. <strong>3, 6, 7 and 9</strong> only will be issued.</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ANNEXURE I TO INOTE NO. {{FINANCIAL_YEAR}}-022-{{INOTE_NO}}-WP-02&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dated {{CURRENT_DATE}}</p><p>{{ITEM_DETAILS}}</p>', 27, '2026-01-04 16:04:49', '2026-01-18 04:26:48');
